00:15:09.560 --> 00:15:12.140
So you admit it, then?

00:15:12.140 --> 00:15:13.430
That's you and your boyfriend?

00:15:13.430 --> 00:15:13.890
Huh?

00:15:13.890 --> 00:15:17.400
The Kouka Troupe does allow
romantic relationships,

00:15:17.400 --> 00:15:21.070
but you can't be so open about it that
others can get a picture of you two alone.

00:15:21.070 --> 00:15:22.740
Especially when you're still a student.

00:15:22.740 --> 00:15:26.910
Oh, but we weren't alone!
Narata-<i>sensei </i>was with us!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:30.030
Really? I'll talk to him, then.

00:15:30.030 --> 00:15:35.540
Oh, no. If this gets out, I'm sure a few
second-years will have it out for you.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.830
But I guess your boyfriend is worth it.

00:15:38.830 --> 00:15:42.130
He's not my boyfriend, though.

00:15:43.710 --> 00:15:47.800
Sorry, Senpai,
can we continue this later?!

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.260
Where are you going?

00:15:49.260 --> 00:15:51.560
I just remembered something
super important I gotta do!

00:15:51.560 --> 00:15:53.640
Don't you dare go!

00:15:53.640 --> 00:15:54.810
It was you, wasn't it?

00:15:54.810 --> 00:15:56.690
Huh?

00:15:56.690 --> 00:15:59.190
You took it <i>way </i>too far this time.

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:02.110
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.440
Do you hate me or something, Risa?

00:16:07.520 --> 00:16:07.650
Sarasa Watanabe

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:07.770
Sarasa Watanabe

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:07.900
Sarasa Watanabe

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.030
Sarasa Watanabe

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:08.780
Sarasa Watanabe

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.280
Hello?

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:15.160
Yeah, I'm still in Kobe...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.540
Naracchi's in trouble?!

00:16:18.250 --> 00:16:21.090
I'm bored of the ocean.

00:16:21.090 --> 00:16:25.050
I've never skipped school before, so I
don't know what I'm supposed to do now.

00:16:25.050 --> 00:16:31.010
I wonder if they noticed I'm gone,
or if they're even worried about me.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.430
Hey, 'scuse me!

00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:36.180
I'm kinda lost. Could you help?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.810
Whoa, hold up, are you Naracchi?

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:44.270
Can I get a selfie?

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.650
Stop.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.650
Leave me alone!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.660
Let go, you creeps!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:50.950
Yo, what the hell?

00:16:50.740 --> 00:16:55.580
Why is it so hard for me
to live in this world?

00:16:50.950 --> 00:16:55.580
He just wanted a selfie!

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:59.290
Why do I have to be like this?

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.960
No. Please.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:03.290
Please stop.

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.170
Hey!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.130
Stop that, right now!

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.550
Get your dirty paws...

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:18.310
...off of her!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.190
What the shit?

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:26.650
She obviously wants you to go away!
She told you to stop!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:27.350
What?

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.940
I'm not scared of you!

00:17:28.940 --> 00:17:31.360
I'm not scared of you <i>or </i>you!

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:35.490
Oh, no... what do I do?!

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.700
Whoa, she really was here!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.580
Ai-<i>chan</i>!

00:17:39.580 --> 00:17:40.620
Ai!

00:17:42.170 --> 00:17:47.170
I said we were through, Ai-<i>chan</i>,
but I'll help you just this once.

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:49.210
Just this once, okay?

00:17:53.140 --> 00:17:57.890
Help! These guys won't leave us alone!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:58.810
She's so loud!

00:17:58.810 --> 00:18:00.560
Help!

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:01.600
And she's huge!

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:06.440
These guys are harassing
two sweet, innocent girls!

00:18:06.440 --> 00:18:07.780
Shit, cops!

00:18:07.780 --> 00:18:10.530
Fine, we'll let you
off the hook this time!

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:15.570
Weaklings.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:22.660
You heard her! You're coming
to the station with us!

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.710
Wait, that's the wrong guy!

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:29.380
Wow, you're a teacher at Kouka?

00:18:29.380 --> 00:18:33.220
Yes. My name is Taichi Narata...

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.930
How did you know I was here?

00:18:35.930 --> 00:18:38.970
Mister Creepy Otaku figured it out!

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.770
I got his number before he left.

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:44.850
The ocean! She's gotta be near the ocean!

00:18:44.850 --> 00:18:45.690
Why?

00:18:45.690 --> 00:18:50.650
Y'see, in the March 2018 issue of POCO mag
and the JPX official newsletter,

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:53.070
she said the ocean makes her feel calm!

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.660
That doesn't really
narrow it down, though.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:19:00.330
I'll do a search on social media!

00:19:00.330 --> 00:19:04.500
This is bad. I gotta find her...
I gotta find her, fast!

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:09.130
And then he really <i>did </i>find you!
Isn't that awesome?!

00:19:09.130 --> 00:19:13.760
Mister Creepy Otaku really
cares about you, Ai-<i>chan</i>.

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.890
Watanabe-<i>san</i>, could you tell them
your side of the story?

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:18.890
Sure!

00:19:26.600 --> 00:19:27.650
Huh?

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:36.240
Here. Wipe your face with this.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:57.010
I didn't mean to. I'm sorry.

00:19:59.510 --> 00:20:01.010
Thank you.

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:07.980
This is the best I can do right now.

00:20:11.480 --> 00:20:12.820
It's okay.

00:20:12.820 --> 00:20:15.900
Really, it's okay. Please don't cry.

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:21.530
I... no, <i>we </i>only ever wanted

00:20:21.530 --> 00:20:25.000
to see you smile, Naracchi.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.670
I don't think I'll ever
get this close to you again,

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:32.210
so please let me keep your handkerchief.

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:35.710
I'm sorry for scaring you before.

00:20:35.710 --> 00:20:39.720
One day, I'll come see you perform
on the big Kouka stage.

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:43.310
When that day comes, I hope I'll see
your beautiful smile once more.

00:20:43.310 --> 00:20:44.680
Farewell.

00:20:52.360 --> 00:20:54.730
And thank you. Until we meet again!

