00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:13.340
Oh, and his real name is
Mikiya Kitaouji! It sounds so cool.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:17.970
Hey, if there's something
I want to forget, but can't,

00:21:17.970 --> 00:21:19.590
what should I do about it?

00:21:20.680 --> 00:21:25.560
Not surprised. Anybody would be weirded
out by a random question like that.

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:31.600
Well, I'm only 15, so there's a lot
I have to learn about the world.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.560
But even if you can't forget
something that happened,

00:21:33.560 --> 00:21:36.480
you can make new memories by having fun

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:38.400
and being passionate about
the things you love.

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:42.490
Just keep overwriting the bad memories
with lots of good ones,

00:21:42.490 --> 00:21:47.040
and eventually,
the bad ones will fade away.

00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:51.250
Because I was walking behind her,

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.540
I couldn't see the expression
on her face when she said that.

00:21:54.540 --> 00:21:57.960
When we got back,
the second-years were waiting for us,

00:21:57.960 --> 00:21:59.720
and for the following week,

00:21:59.720 --> 00:22:04.680
Watanabe-<i>san </i>and I had our
morning cleaning hours doubled.

